DailySplash
===========

DailySplash (Nextcloud app id "dailysplash") is a MODIFIED version of
"Splash" (Nextcloud app id "unsplash"), https://github.com/nextcloud/unsplash

Original work:
  Conception: Jan-Christoph Borchardt and Lukas Reschke
  Development and maintenance: Felix Nüsse, Marius Wieschollek
  Bing Wallpaper provider: Bruce Mubangwa
  and the other contributors listed in the upstream git history.

