GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later
version. See LICENSE.md. Original copyright notices are kept in the source
files; files changed for DailySplash say so in their header.

Modifications (2026), starting from upstream commit 5aa215d (3.2.0-dev):
  - renamed app id, namespace (OCA\DailySplash), routes, settings keys,
    app data folder, CSS classes and l10n domain so that it can coexist
    with the original app;
  - targets Nextcloud 35 / PHP 8.5, uses only public OCP APIs;
  - images are downloaded server side by a background job (with timeouts,
    size and type checks) and served by Nextcloud itself; the browser never
    contacts the image provider;
  - removed the Unsplash API, Wallhaven and random Wikimedia providers.

